put.summary:
Customer §39 master "Turn On/Off All Notifications" toggle.
Flips every notification toggle to enabled;
SecurityAlerts stays enabled regardless (skill §15 rule 4).

post.summary:
Move a saved item back to the cart. Re-runs the Catalog
lookup so the customer sees current price + availability;
returns the updated StyleMint.Modules.CartCheckout.Entity.Dtos.CartViewDto on success.

StyleMint.Modules.Identity.Enums.Address.description:
Geocoding / postal-validation outcome from a third-party provider (Google Maps,
Mapbox, etc.). `Verified` means the provider confirmed a deliverable address;
`Partial` means usable but ambiguous (e.g. street resolved, unit didn't);
`Unverifiable` means no match.

StyleMint.Modules.Identity.Enums.Subscri.description:
Creator subscription tiers (§9M Upgrade Subscription Plan).
Basic = free tier with limits; Pro = recommended (most popular);
Enterprise = unlimited. Stored as smallint.

sourceVideoUrl.description:
Downloadable bytes URL the creator's mobile flow uploaded to before
scheduling. Required for adapters that upload (YouTube Shorts);
null/empty leaves byte-upload targets fail-closed at adapter time.
